# KatzenVet Admin UI Architecture

Premium corporate dashboard (Stripe/Linear). Full spec: `docs/ADMIN-UI-ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## NEVER violate

1. **No `mat-dialog-title`** — use `<h2 class="admin-dialog-title">` (Material teleports the directive).
2. **Dialog CSS** — target `.admin-dialog-panel` or component `:host`, never `.admin-content`.
3. **Detail labels** — stack vertically; `display: block !important` on label and value.
4. **Actions column** — `mat-column-acciones` fixed `120px`; `mat-icon-button` + `matTooltip` in `.row-actions`.
5. **Status chips complete** — `.estado-badge` / `.admin-badge` must render fully (no clipped right edge). Do not shrink `mat-column-estado` below ~148px; keep `overflow: visible` on estado cells. Canonical CSS: `src/styles/admin-table.scss`.
6. **Person names complete on wide screens** — veterinario / cliente / doctor / dueño / `mat-column-nombre` must show **full names** on wide viewports (no ellipsis when space exists). Medium: wrap ≤2 lines; narrow: wrap + `.table-scroll`. Canonical: `src/styles/admin-table.scss`.
7. **Destructive action copy = "Borrar"** — UI labels, tooltips, menu items, legends and SweetAlert must say **Borrar** (never «Baja lógica» / «Dar de baja»). Internally it remains soft-delete (`activo: false`); method names/comments may keep `bajaLogica*`. Prefer «Borrar» over «Eliminar».
8. **Multi-line cells** — fecha+hora (`.fecha-compact`) and paciente+dueño (`.cell-primary`) need visible vertical gap (~4–8px).
9. **Desktop width** — admin pages use full `.admin-content` width (≥1200px); no nested tighter `max-width` on `.admin-page`; flexible text columns absorb space (no empty gaps while text looks cramped).
10. **Auth/portal/landing balance** — Toda UI nueva (auth, portal, admin, landing) debe verse coherente con el design system, centrada/equilibrada en desktop y responsiva; no layouts aplastados a un lado con huecos vacíos. Auth shells: reutilizar `.admin-auth-page` / `.portal-login-wrap` (incluir CSS en `styleUrls`; la encapsulación no hereda estilos de otro componente).

## Tokens (use CSS vars)

`--katzen-verde`, `--katzen-verde-fuerte`, `--admin-bg`, `--admin-surface`, `--admin-border`, `--admin-radius-sm/md/lg`.

## Refactor checklist

1. Remove layout-breaking Material directives from HTML.
2. Apply `.table-shell` (lists) or `.admin-form-layout` / `.admin-dialog-layout` (dialogs).
3. Primary actions: `.btn-primary-teal` on `mat-raised-button`.

## Dialog config

```typescript
{ width: '840px', maxWidth: '96vw', panelClass: 'admin-dialog-panel' }
```

Compact pickers (timepicker): `admin-dialog-shell--picker` + `ADMIN_DIALOG_TIMEPICKER` (~420px). Body padding ≥28×32, gap ≥24px, footer ≥18×28×22. Do not use `--picker` on large CRUD forms.

## Loading (obligatorio)

- Usar `LoadingService` con mensaje contextual: `Cargando…` / `Guardando…` / `Eliminando…` / `Actualizando…` (`LOADING_MESSAGES`).
- Cada `show()` → `hide()` en success **y** error (`finally` o `wrap`).
- **No** doble `show` (diálogo + padre): deja el overlay trabado por el contador.
- Spec: `specs/005-loading-feedback-ux/` · detalle: `docs/ADMIN-UI-ARCHITECTURE.md` § Loading.
